{"id":27793,"author":"Riilo","body":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003ePart 1: About You\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhat is your age?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e14\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhat is your Discord ID? (If you don’t have Discord, create an account and join the\u0026nbsp;Avicus\u0026nbsp;Discord server before answering this question.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eRilo#5735\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eHow active can you be in order to contribute to the team?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eI can be active throughout the day. I can be on for at least 3 hours every day. I love making maps so I will be committed to the job.\u0026nbsp; \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other applicants that qualify you to be a builder?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eI like to help, if somebody wants me to help them with a map, I would be honoured to do so. I can cooperate in the making of maps, and I'm not the bossy\u0026nbsp;kind. I can easily complete assigned tasks/projects without any issues, and I would do the task well.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003ePart 2: \u0026nbsp;Skills\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhat do you think is a necessity in order to hone your map building skills in terms of gameplay?'\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eI assume this means, what’s necessary in order to have good gameplay on maps. If it doesn’t mean that, please correct me and\u0026nbsp;I’ll\u0026nbsp;reanswer.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003eI feel that islands can’t be too thin, but can't be too large. If you do have large islands they should be quick to move across on, or not affect the map too much. The map also can't be over detailed with aesthetics creating it either difficult to rush, defend or even play on generally.\u0026nbsp;The map should have a decent amount of pvp space, so you can’t get knocked off in 1 or 2 hits if you are standing in the centre of the island. Also, make sure there is not too much void, so teams can bridge over to the other side in a short period of time. \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eHow comfortable are you with\u0026nbsp;Avicus\u0026nbsp;XML when it comes to creating it and\u0026nbsp;analyzing\u0026nbsp;it to fix possible errors?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI am inexperienced with Avicus XML, but that can change easily. I am enthusiastic about learning new things, and am willing to learn anytime. I am currently working on learning to XML, and am working to try to do my own XML.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eAs\u0026nbsp;builder, would you focus on building maps, creating XML, or both?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eAs a builder, I will be mainly focusing on building maps, and working with others to create maps. I would like to also learn how to XML and work on other projects.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003ePart 3: Past Experience\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eProvide the links\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;the threads of two maps that you have submitted to the\u0026nbsp;Avicus\u0026nbsp;forums.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eThese are my three best maps, but I have made MANY bad ones which I have understood how they were bad.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/07391b25a\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/07391b25a\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e (Croatia CTF) (Building)\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/254f52c4f\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/254f52c4f\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e (Driftwood DTM) (Building \u0026amp; ½ XML – Distraction is doing the regions)\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/f0c685b4a\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/f0c685b4a\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e (Infinity CTW) (Half updated) (Building)\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cb\u003eHave you had any past experience with building maps or creating XML, other than with the two maps linked above? If so, explain.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/b\u003eI’ve never really submitted maps to other servers, but I have built a lot of maps that have got denied which I have learnt from. (in 2014/2015, I hadn’t learnt from it). Also, I never really have had past experience in XML considering I never attempted to do it on OCN. \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003ePart 4:\u0026nbsp;Self Reflection\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a builder?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eI want to be a builder for Avicus so I can be part of the map development team. I want to be assigned projects and tasks so I can create them. Building has always been a passion for me, and I really want to show it. I understand how Avicus maps work, what good ones and bad ones look like depending on aesthetics and gameplay. I am very involved into this server/community so I know about how each map can be different, depending on the style (ctw, 1 hit 1 kill, dtc, crossed game modes, competitive maps). On competitive maps especially, I understand how they are different to public maps and what needs to be there for the competitive map to play well. \u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eHow do you think you will help the map development team?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eFirstly, I know I’m not great at XML, so I feel I can help a lot in building and giving feedback. Like I said above, I understand maps, and how they play. I know how to build maps for every single gamemode, and I feel as a builder, this is something I could help out with. I know I could be a really handy builder, helping people out like mentioned above, and if anybody needs me for something, I will help them as much as I can.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003ePart 1: About You\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhat is your age?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e14\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhat is your Discord ID? (If you don’t have Discord, create an account and join the\u0026nbsp;Avicus\u0026nbsp;Discord server before answering this question.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eRilo#5735\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eHow active can you be in order to contribute to the team?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eI can be active throughout the day. I can be on for at least 3 hours every day. I love making maps so I will be committed to the job.\u0026nbsp; \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other applicants that qualify you to be a builder?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eI like to help, if somebody wants me to help them with a map, I would be honoured to do so. I can cooperate in the making of maps, and I'm not the bossy\u0026nbsp;kind. I can easily complete assigned tasks/projects without any issues, and I would do the task well.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003ePart 2: \u0026nbsp;Skills\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhat do you think is a necessity in order to hone your map building skills in terms of gameplay?'\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eI assume this means, what’s necessary in order to have good gameplay on maps. If it doesn’t mean that, please correct me and\u0026nbsp;I’ll\u0026nbsp;reanswer.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003eI feel that islands can’t be too thin, but can't be too large. If you do have large islands they should be quick to move across on, or not affect the map too much. The map also can't be over detailed with aesthetics creating it either difficult to rush, defend or even play on generally.\u0026nbsp;The map should have a decent amount of pvp space, so you can’t get knocked off in 1 or 2 hits if you are standing in the centre of the island. Also, make sure there is not too much void, so teams can bridge over to the other side in a short period of time. \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eHow comfortable are you with\u0026nbsp;Avicus\u0026nbsp;XML when it comes to creating it and\u0026nbsp;analyzing\u0026nbsp;it to fix possible errors?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI am inexperienced with Avicus XML, but that can change easily. I am enthusiastic about learning new things, and am willing to learn anytime. I am currently working on learning to XML, and am working to try to do my own XML.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eAs\u0026nbsp;builder, would you focus on building maps, creating XML, or both?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eAs a builder, I will be mainly focusing on building maps, and working with others to create maps. I would like to also learn how to XML and work on other projects.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003ePart 3: Past Experience\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eProvide the links\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;the threads of two maps that you have submitted to the\u0026nbsp;Avicus\u0026nbsp;forums.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eThese are my three best maps, but I have made MANY bad ones which I have understood how they were bad.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/07391b25a\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/07391b25a\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e (Croatia CTF) (Building)\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/254f52c4f\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/254f52c4f\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e (Driftwood DTM) (Building \u0026amp; ½ XML – Distraction is doing the regions)\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/f0c685b4a\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/f0c685b4a\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e (Infinity CTW) (Half updated) (Building)\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cb\u003eHave you had any past experience with building maps or creating XML, other than with the two maps linked above? If so, explain.\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/b\u003eI’ve never really submitted maps to other servers, but I have built a lot of maps that have got denied which I have learnt from. (in 2014/2015, I hadn’t learnt from it). Also, I never really have had past experience in XML considering I never attempted to do it on OCN. \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003ePart 4:\u0026nbsp;Self Reflection\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a builder?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eI want to be a builder for Avicus so I can be part of the map development team. I want to be assigned projects and tasks so I can create them. Building has always been a passion for me, and I really want to show it. I understand how Avicus maps work, what good ones and bad ones look like depending on aesthetics and gameplay. I am very involved into this server/community so I know about how each map can be different, depending on the style (ctw, 1 hit 1 kill, dtc, crossed game modes, competitive maps). On competitive maps especially, I understand how they are different to public maps and what needs to be there for the competitive map to play well. \u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c!--[endif]--\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eHow do you think you will help the map development team?\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"\u003eFirstly, I know I’m not great at XML, so I feel I can help a lot in building and giving feedback. Like I said above, I understand maps, and how they play. I know how to build maps for every single gamemode, and I feel as a builder, this is something I could help out with. I know I could be a really handy builder, helping people out like mentioned above, and if anybody needs me for something, I will help them as much as I can.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1499124270,"title":"Builder App - Riilo","replies":[{"id":377355,"author":"_DISTRACTION_","body":"Your application has been accepted. You will be messaged on discord with more information.","body_tagged":"Your application has been accepted. You will be messaged on discord with more information.","created_at":1501643847}]}